 that we understand exactly what it means and how to test for it. linearity makes our life easier

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,960
 in lots of ways. numerically simulating linear systems is generally much easier than their nonlinear

6
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:32,640
 counterparts and so is designing controllers for these kinds of systems. In fact linearity is

